<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.cabal.faces ~ the acting face's key in a realm: the nym a voucher names

`lares cabal face --realm <id>` stands the acting face (`--face N`, else the one face standing open; several refuse by name) at the Nexus the realm stands under and prints its key there, the joiner nym a voucher names. `--nexus <aid>` names the Nexus at the vessel's first act in the realm.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`face` params=`realm/0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef ~ print the acting face's key in the realm`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ realm · nexus · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`realm` params=`takes/doc-id needs/required ~ the cabal-realm doc id, 64 hex`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nexus` params=`takes/aid ~ the Nexus at this vessel's first act in the realm; the ledger keeps it after`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the acting face, by persona index; absent, the one face standing open`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand key/face-at-nexus ~ the store door acts as the face, its key at the realm's Nexus`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · CabalFaceError · store-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.cabal.faces realm/0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef]] ~ --realm expects a 64-hex cabal-realm doc id`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`CabalFaceError` params=`~ the face holds no key there, or several faces stand open`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`store-refused` params=`~ the store door refused, or no vessel answers; the line names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`face` params=`exit/0 fields/[[face realm nexusAid]] ~ the face's key at the realm's Nexus`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares cabal face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares cabal face]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

